WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.901 --> 00:00:16.144
"Are you sure you can help?"

2
00:00:16.364 --> 00:00:18.125
Wukong asked the Buddha Maitreya.

3
00:00:19.385 --> 00:00:20.445
Brows is powerful.

4
00:00:21.126 --> 00:00:23.386
He captured everyone with a magic cloth.

5
00:00:24.166 --> 00:00:26.027
He trapped me in a pair of cymbals."

6
00:00:27.447 --> 00:00:29.768
can defeat Yellow Brows," said Maitreya.

7
00:00:30.720 --> 00:00:31.881
"He used to be my student.

8
00:00:32.982 --> 00:00:36.585
The cloth and cymbals are precious Buddhist treasures that he stole from me."

9
00:00:38.366 --> 00:00:39.227
Wukong gulped.

10
00:00:40.068 --> 00:00:43.891
"Sorry, but I, um destroyed the cymbals."

11
00:00:45.112 --> 00:00:46.152
Maitreya smiled.

12
00:00:46.172 --> 00:00:47.434
"Don't worry about that.

13
00:00:48.454 --> 00:00:49.936
must capture Yellow Brows.

14
00:00:50.916 --> 00:00:51.937
I'll tell you my plan."

15
00:00:55.140 --> 00:00:57.061
stormed up to the monastery door again.

16
00:00:57.081 --> 00:00:59.423
"Yellow Brows!"

17
00:00:59.723 --> 00:01:01.140
he shouted.

18
00:01:01.220 --> 00:01:03.943
"Return my friends or I'll smash your entire mountain!"

19
00:01:04.743 --> 00:01:07.746
The door flew open, and Yellow Brows stepped out.

20
00:01:11.028 --> 00:01:12.689
dare you threaten me?

21
00:01:13.670 --> 00:01:16.232
Do you know how powerful I am?"

22
00:01:17.593 --> 00:01:19.835
"You're not powerful," said the monkey.

23
00:01:19.855 --> 00:01:22.657
"You just think you are because you have that cloth.

24
00:01:23.658 --> 00:01:25.840
I bet you're too scared to fight me without it."

25
00:01:25.860 --> 00:01:30.624
"I'm not scared of you," said the demon.

26
00:01:31.680 --> 00:01:34.461
He went back inside and came back a moment later.

27
00:01:35.861 --> 00:01:38.142
He was holding a heavy wooden club.

28
00:01:40.123 --> 00:01:43.464
Wukong pulled out his iron bar as the demon rushed toward him.

29
00:01:45.364 --> 00:01:47.765
Their weapons smashed together again and again.

30
00:01:48.745 --> 00:01:52.146
As he fought the demon, Wukong took small steps backward.

31
00:01:53.107 --> 00:01:56.308
Slowly he moved the fight away from the monastery.

32
00:02:01.444 --> 00:02:04.206
Soon they were fighting in the valley at the bottom of the mountain.

33
00:02:05.547 --> 00:02:09.791
Wukong took another swing at Yellow Brows and then pretended to be scared.

34
00:02:09.811 --> 00:02:12.393
"You are too powerful!"

35
00:02:12.633 --> 00:02:13.394
cried the monkey.

36
00:02:14.294 --> 00:02:15.375
can't fight you anymore!"

37
00:02:16.236 --> 00:02:17.417
He turned and ran away.

38
00:02:18.438 --> 00:02:20.699
"Hey!" yelled Yellow Brows.

39
00:02:22.181 --> 00:02:23.602
back here, coward!"

40
00:02:24.402 --> 00:02:25.944
The demon ran after Wukong.

41
00:02:28.265 --> 00:02:31.168
The monkey ran through some woods and into a melon field.

42
00:02:33.172 --> 00:02:34.173
Brows chased him.

43
00:02:34.193 --> 00:02:37.856
"Where are you, Wukong?"

44
00:02:38.096 --> 00:02:38.697
he shouted.

45
00:02:40.298 --> 00:02:42.019
the demon noticed all the melons.

46
00:02:43.060 --> 00:02:44.061
He licked his lips.

47
00:02:44.141 --> 00:02:48.565
"These melons look delicious," he said to himself.

48
00:02:49.585 --> 00:02:51.107
farmer was working nearby.

49
00:02:51.587 --> 00:02:52.548
He had a big belly.

50
00:02:54.609 --> 00:02:56.311
farmer!" called Yellow Brows.

51
00:02:56.331 --> 00:02:58.853
"Give me one of your melons!"

52
00:03:00.574 --> 00:03:02.516
farmer put down his rake and smiled.

53
00:03:03.348 --> 00:03:04.789
He walked over to the demon.

54
00:03:07.592 --> 00:03:09.774
"I'll find a nice, ripe melon for you."

55
00:03:10.694 --> 00:03:12.155
The farmer searched the ground.

56
00:03:15.338 --> 00:03:16.859
he held up a ripe melon.

57
00:03:16.879 --> 00:03:17.960
"Here you go!"

58
00:03:19.341 --> 00:03:21.563
Yellow Brows lifted the melon to take a bite.

59
00:03:23.004 --> 00:03:25.787
Suddenly the melon shrank to the size of a berry.

60
00:03:26.668 --> 00:03:29.670
It leaped out of his hand and went right down his throat.

61
00:03:33.248 --> 00:03:34.488
demon fell to his knees.

62
00:03:34.508 --> 00:03:38.350
"Ugh! What was wrong with that melon?"

63
00:03:39.530 --> 00:03:42.411
Inside the demon, Wukong punched and kicked.

64
00:03:44.111 --> 00:03:45.151
Pow! Boomph!

65
00:03:45.452 --> 00:03:49.973
Pow! cried Yellow Brows.

66
00:03:51.333 --> 00:03:53.194
Then he noticed the farmer was gone.

67
00:03:54.014 --> 00:03:56.575
Instead, Maitreya stood over him.

68
00:03:57.875 --> 00:03:58.915
glared at the demon.

69
00:03:58.935 --> 00:04:04.640
"Give me my magic cloth."

70
00:04:04.720 --> 00:04:06.901
"Y-yes, Master."

71
00:04:07.542 --> 00:04:11.464
Yellow Brows pulled the cloth from his robe and handed it to Maitreya.

72
00:04:11.484 --> 00:04:16.387
"You may come out now, Wukong," said Maitreya.

73
00:04:17.287 --> 00:04:19.809
A tiny Wukong leaped from the demon's nose.

74
00:04:20.850 --> 00:04:23.031
Maitreya threw the cloth at Yellow Brows.

75
00:04:24.452 --> 00:04:26.873
It wrapped around the demon and became small.

76
00:04:29.675 --> 00:04:31.856
Maitreya put the bundle into a pocket.

77
00:04:33.141 --> 00:04:34.602
returned to his normal size.

78
00:04:37.604 --> 00:04:39.506
He and Maitreya went to the monastery.

79
00:04:40.427 --> 00:04:44.270
Maitreya recited a spell, and the cymbals repaired themselves.

80
00:04:46.892 --> 00:04:48.073
smiled at Wukong.

81
00:04:48.093 --> 00:04:48.994
"Good luck!"

82
00:04:50.075 --> 00:04:53.798
Then he vanished.

83
00:04:53.878 --> 00:04:56.640
Wukong untied his companions and the other spirits.

84
00:04:58.562 --> 00:05:02.778
The dragon, the turtle, and the serpent thanked the monkey and flew away.

85
00:05:02.798 --> 00:05:05.881
"Thank you, Wukong," said the Tang Monk.

86
00:05:06.822 --> 00:05:09.625
"I'm sorry for not believing you when you warned us about this place."

87
00:05:11.286 --> 00:05:15.550
laughed. "Maybe you'll believe me one of these days, Master!"

88
00:05:22.057 --> 00:05:24.980
The travelers went outside and continued west.
